# This file exists solely to keep the models/ directory present in git.
#
# Trained .pth weight files are gitignored (see .gitignore) because they are
# large binaries that don't belong in source control. Without this file,
# a fresh `git clone` has no models/ directory at all, which breaks
# `backend/Dockerfile`'s `COPY models/ /app/models/` step during CI image
# builds (Trivy scans, docker-build jobs, etc.).
#
# Do not delete this file even after adding real trained weights here.
